1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,910
Answer these questions:

2
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:11,740
Who got Mi Nuong?

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:16,970
A. Son Tinh

4
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:21,910
B. Thuy Tinh

5
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:33,280
Answer: Son Tinh got Mi Nuong.

6
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:47,880
Thuy Tinh came late and didn't get Mi Nuong, what did Thuy Tinh do?

7
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:59,910
Answer: Thuy Tinh got angry, raised water to chase and attack Son Tinh.

8
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:12,280
When Thuy Tinh flooded rice fields and houses, what did Son Tinh do to fight Thuy Tinh?

9
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:23,340
Answer: Son Tinh used magic to raise mountains high, blocking flood water.

10
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:32,280
Finally, who won?

11
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:41,880
Answer: Finally, Son Tinh won.

12
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:49,600
From then, every year Thuy Tinh also raises water to attack Son Tinh, causing floods.

13
00:01:49,850 --> 00:01:54,420
But every time Thuy Tinh loses.

14
00:01:55,080 --> 00:02:06,970
Story shows imagination of ancient people. In your opinion, what does story really want to say?

15
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:24,020
Answer: Story explains annual flood phenomenon and people fight flood very persistently.

